[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7032.709, "timestamp": "01:57:12", "text": "是什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7036.95, "timestamp": "01:57:16", "text": "意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7038.95, "timestamp": "01:57:18", "text": "只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7041.43, "timestamp": "01:57:21", "text": "我一個人。好吧，舒瑪先生，你真是太倒楣了。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7054.79, "timestamp": "01:57:34", "text": "。我當時正在和一個女人聊天，她說：「我們拯救了超級"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7059.99, "timestamp": "01:57:39", "text": "地球。」 好吧，沒事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7062.47, "timestamp": "01:57:42", "text": "我當時想：「哦，是啊，這說得通，因為我不會超級冒險"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7065.75, "timestamp": "01:57:45", "text": "。」他說我剛才說的是地獄"}]